{'symbol': 'CME', 'date': '2023-03-09 15:39:00', 'title': 'CME GROUP SOFR FUTURES AND OPTIONS REACH SINGLE-DAY TRADING, OPEN INTEREST RECORDS', 'text': "CHICAGO, MARCH 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CME GROUP, THE WORLD'S LEADING DERIVATIVES MARKETPLACE, TODAY ANNOUNCED NEW MILESTONES IN THE GROWTH OF ITS SOFR DERIVATIVES CONTRACTS, WITH A SINGLE-DAY RECORD OF 9,784,528 SOFR FUTURES AND OPTIONS TRADED ON MARCH 7 AND RECORD OPEN INTEREST (OI) OF 54,666,191 CONTRACTS ON MARCH 8."}{'symbol': 'CME', 'date': '2023-03-09 09:00:00', 'title': 'CME GROUP ANNOUNCES INITIAL TRADING OF NEW CROP WEEKLY OPTIONS', 'text': "CHICAGO , MARCH 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CME GROUP, THE WORLD'S LEADING DERIVATIVES MARKETPLACE, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT OPEN INTEREST IN NEW CROP WEEKLY OPTIONS HAS SURPASSED 500 CONTRACTS, WHILE A TOTAL OF 984 CONTRACTS ACROSS 28 UNIQUE ACCOUNT NUMBERS HAVE TRADED SINCE LAUNCHING ON JANUARY 23. NEW CROP WEEKLY OPTIONS BUILD ON THE SUCCESS OF SHORT-DATED NEW CROP OPTIONS, WHICH LAUNCHED A DECADE AGO AND ACHIEVED RECORD AVERAGE DAILY VOLUME (ADV) OF 11,000 CONTRACTS IN 2022."}